From c583827a354674180dc8856eb65aeb3f0afa5ee9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thor downstream maintainers
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Strip known tracking parameters from top-level URLs
X-Downstream-Base: Chromium 151.0.7922.47
X-Downstream-Base-Commit: c583827a354674180dc8856eb65aeb3f0afa5ee9
X-License: Chromium BSD-style license (LICENSE)
X-Scope: Outermost main-frame GET navigations and their redirects only.
 Static, conservative URL cleanup is not ad/tracker blocking, CNAME
 uncloaking, subresource filtering, or signed filter-list enforcement.
---
